From 229a20dc4779e7e3d66dcb06ec75017bebf2c184 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Heyu Hu <huheyu2@huawei.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Feb 2026 23:23:57 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] urma: ipourma resource management

Offering: URMA
URMA inclusion
category: feature
bugzilla: NA

----------------------------------------------

This patch adds ipourma resource management module
with resource initialization/deinitialization, reserved data
plane interfaces and network device options,introduces
netlink and ethtool modules.

Signed-off-by: Heyu Hu <huheyu2@huawei.com>
